meta {
  name: Declare income (ISA)
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/contracts/{{contractId}}/income-declarations
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{studentToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "period": "2026-11",
    "grossMonthlyIncomeCents": 215000
  }
}

docs {
  Income share agreements only: the student declares the gross income of a month (`period` as YYYY-MM; 0 when none), from its first day until the end of the 4th of the next month. On the 5th the month is assessed and charged; a closed or assessed month answers `period_not_open`. The happy path contract is an instalment loan, so this answers an error there; apply with `"product": { "kind": "isa" }` to try it.
}
